<p><strong>Date basis:</strong> {{ ['assigned'=>'Assigned (creation date)','due'=>'Due deadline (current deadline)','completed'=>'Current completion date','reviewed'=>'Current review date'][request('basis','due')] }}. The inclusive date range uses Africa/Johannesburg. Every count uses this selected task cohort. Unknown historical dates are excluded when filtering by that date.</p>
<p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>First-completion on-time rate:</strong> on-time first completions / non-cancelled tasks with at least one recorded completion attempt. Each attempt keeps its original deadline. Latest punctuality uses the latest completion attempt. Optional review does not affect completion time or punctuality.</p>
<p style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Completed:</strong> tasks currently Completed. Reviewed and Not reviewed are separate counts within Completed. <strong>Open:</strong> Assigned or In progress. Reopened work returns to Assigned and needs a new completion; previous attempts remain in history. Completed and Cancelled tasks are not overdue. Corrections count historical returned attempts and new reopening events. Cancelled tasks are excluded from punctuality denominators.</p>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Categories and priorities provide context. Task counts are not a complete productivity score. Elapsed time is not hours worked.</p>
